+++ b/releasenotes/notes/rename-json-rpc-tls-opts-88508aa569381c4d.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+deprecations:
+  - |
+    The ``[json_rpc] tls_minimum_version`` and ``[json_rpc] tls_ciphers``
+    config options have been renamed to ``[json_rpc]
+    server_tls_minimum_version`` and ``[json_rpc] server_tls_ciphers``,
+    respectively, to distinguish them from new client-only options.
